00:18:10.859 --> 00:18:15.862
While the Indian kings were among the largest fortunes in the world at the beginning of the 20th century,

00:18:16.322 --> 00:18:20.105
they must today make room for fortunes which started from nothing.

00:18:20.645 --> 00:18:24.167
Descendants of the servant castes or even from untouchables,

00:18:24.507 --> 00:18:26.748
