00:18:40.756 --> 00:18:46.386
Yet it is here that one of the most incredible cases of social mobility in modern India began.

00:18:47.265 --> 00:18:50.048
This village saw the birth of Kalpana Sarosh.

00:18:50.428 --> 00:18:50.749
Today,

00:18:50.809 --> 00:18:53.992
the head of the real estate empire worth 300 million euros.

00:18:54.392 --> 00:18:58.216
Her father was a police officer and her family owned no land.

00:18:58.696 --> 00:19:01.159
This is the house.

00:19:01.499 --> 00:19:03.942
My relationship is that I was born here.

00:19:17.452 --> 00:19:19.934
The only inhabitant of this mud hut is her

00:19:20.674 --> 00:19:21.415
85-year-old aunt,

00:19:21.655 --> 00:19:24.177
who doesn't want to leave despite her niece's wealth.

00:19:26.417 --> 00:19:36.284
There is a clay stove and she burns wood to cook food.

00:19:36.324 --> 00:19:38.045
She makes food for her own.

00:19:38.065 --> 00:19:40.607
She doesn't want to depend on her daughter-in-law or son.

00:19:41.087 --> 00:19:44.668
So she earns and eats her own food.

00:19:44.669 --> 00:19:44.808
How is it?

00:19:44.809 --> 00:19:44.988
It's good,

00:19:44.989 --> 00:19:45.128
isn't it?

00:19:45.129 --> 00:19:49.049
It's good.

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:55.171
Her return to the village may bring a crowd,

00:19:55.511 --> 00:19:58.251
but Kalpana was born with an enormous handicap.

00:19:58.732 --> 00:20:02.232
She grew up in a community that has always been marginalised,

00:20:02.412 --> 00:20:03.273
the Untouchables.

00:20:06.453 --> 00:20:08.855
This is the place where we can see the gutter.

00:20:08.955 --> 00:20:14.438
This side is the place called Kunbipura.

00:20:14.538 --> 00:20:16.400
This is Suvarnabha.

00:20:16.401 --> 00:20:19.622
And this side is the place of the Buddhists.

00:20:21.563 --> 00:20:22.084
In India,

00:20:22.404 --> 00:20:25.929
the untouchables are the lowest in the Hindu social hierarchy.

00:20:26.629 --> 00:20:32.096
A shunned population considered impure and confined to the most unpleasant jobs.

00:21:06.085 --> 00:21:11.793
medical camp which offers free ophthalmological care and glasses.

00:21:32.238 --> 00:21:35.160
The nearest hospital is a two-hour walk away from here.

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:37.281
Today is a real luxury for the villagers.

00:21:55.201 --> 00:21:55.621
nations,

00:21:56.002 --> 00:21:57.763
Kalpana takes care of everything.

00:21:58.284 --> 00:22:01.526
A banquet is even served in a tent put up for the occasion.

00:22:01.966 --> 00:22:05.009
The village takes on a festive air around the nation's child.

00:22:05.329 --> 00:22:06.930
She even serves the meal herself.

