We used to put mangoes or eggs in it and eat it.

00:22:26.186 --> 00:22:26.587
MALCOLM BRABANT,

00:22:26.588 --> 00:22:32.292
Kalpana Sarosh's story is one of a young girl who rebels against a destiny which was written for her.

00:22:32.933 --> 00:22:34.495
Married at the age of 12,

00:22:34.775 --> 00:22:38.098
