00:22:38.559 --> 00:22:40.360
Her father got her a divorce,

00:22:40.761 --> 00:22:42.863
but her return to the village was difficult.

00:22:45.145 --> 00:22:45.765
Even after coming here,

00:22:45.825 --> 00:22:48.827
