00:23:05.734 --> 00:23:07.994
We will do something to show the world.

00:23:08.014 --> 00:23:09.275
And we started our journey.

00:23:09.375 --> 00:23:09.535
So,

00:23:09.575 --> 00:23:12.596
the coffee struggle started from then.

00:23:27.476 --> 00:23:35.620
At the age of 16 Kalpana decided to leave for Bombay with some savings in her pocket and her only talents as a seamstress.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:40.242
Working in a garment factory she patiently saved the small son.

00:23:40.842 --> 00:23:44.284
