the weekend in Goa is a reunion not to be missed,

00:30:19.726 --> 00:30:21.106
the breakfast especially.

00:30:21.546 --> 00:30:23.327
The menu includes truffle omelet,

00:30:23.607 --> 00:30:24.108
caviar,

00:30:24.468 --> 00:30:27.389
Japanese chocolates and fine vintage wines.

00:30:27.953 --> 00:30:29.834
The champagne wishes and caviar dreams.

00:30:33.016 --> 00:30:38.939
30 years in the making.

00:30:39.079 --> 00:30:41.260
Right,

00:30:41.300 --> 00:30:41.420
Gautam?

00:30:41.421 --> 00:30:42.041
About 40 years in the making,

00:30:42.042 --> 00:30:42.321
42 years.

00:30:42.322 --> 00:30:42.801
Something like that,

00:30:42.802 --> 00:30:43.581
roughly.

00:30:43.582 --> 00:30:43.882
Long years.

00:30:43.902 --> 00:30:47.524
Gautama organised this trip himself and brought in goods from London by plane.

00:30:48.064 --> 00:30:48.684
This weekend,

00:30:48.685 --> 00:30:52.446
he opens the doors to his billionaire lifestyle to his closest friends.

00:30:56.288 --> 00:30:57.569
This is Gautam's night luxury.

00:30:57.669 --> 00:30:57.789
No,

00:30:58.550 --> 00:30:59.651
he likes super luxury.

00:30:59.691 --> 00:31:02.753
In what sense?

00:31:03.874 --> 00:31:04.955
He's achieved what he has,

00:31:05.055 --> 00:31:07.377
so he obviously wants the best,

00:31:08.178 --> 00:31:09.459
best available wherever.

00:31:10.680 --> 00:31:11.401
Whether it's Bombay,

00:31:11.461 --> 00:31:11.641
Goa,

00:31:12.181 --> 00:31:12.401
yes,

00:31:12.882 --> 00:31:13.943
he loves luxury.

00:31:14.563 --> 00:31:16.245
It's not easy to lead this lifestyle.

00:31:16.265 --> 00:31:17.005
It's easy to say,

00:31:17.365 --> 00:31:19.507
I wish I had a yacht or I wish I had an aircraft.

00:31:19.808 --> 00:31:22.190
But I know a lot of the millionaires and billionaires.

00:31:22.230 --> 00:31:24.331
I don't know many who do what he does.

00:31:31.137 --> 00:31:32.358
By the end of the morning,

00:31:32.438 --> 00:31:33.158
the group of

00:31:33.658 --> 00:31:36.979
50-somethings have already fallen back into adolescence.

00:31:37.639 --> 00:31:41.280
It is only the size and the style of the toys that has changed.

00:31:41.760 --> 00:31:45.181
Goa has become the stomping ground of India's billionaires,

00:31:45.601 --> 00:31:47.882
and that's because it is right next to their city,

00:31:48.262 --> 00:31:48.622
Bombay.

00:31:49.202 --> 00:31:50.003
The mega city,

00:31:50.283 --> 00:31:52.423
with a population of over 20 million,

00:31:52.743 --> 00:31:55.304
accounts for more than half of the country's super-rich.

00:31:57.225 --> 00:31:58.165
Their latest whim?

00:31:58.561 --> 00:32:00.843
is to have towers built in the heart of the city.

00:32:01.463 --> 00:32:04.826
Some have been estimated at more than a billion euros.

00:32:06.687 --> 00:32:08.509
These 37 stories,

00:32:08.569 --> 00:32:10.010
which dominate the seafront,

00:32:10.430 --> 00:32:13.052
are Guatama Singania's future residence.

00:32:14.514 --> 00:32:18.917
The only part of the tower that has been built at the moment are these two levels,

00:32:19.217 --> 00:32:21.179
dedicated to the family business,

00:32:21.479 --> 00:32:23.280
textiles and their famous brand,

00:32:23.581 --> 00:32:23.921
Raymond.

00:32:24.717 --> 00:32:28.761
This company is a beast of 70 million euros of annual turnover,

00:32:29.181 --> 00:32:29.461
60%

00:32:29.882 --> 00:32:33.485
of market shares and 3,000 shops across the country.

00:32:34.066 --> 00:32:34.366
Today,

00:32:34.426 --> 00:32:37.128
the group's big boss inspects his brand's flagship.

00:32:37.129 --> 00:32:43.274
How are your sales been?

00:32:43.275 --> 00:32:43.714
Doing great,

00:32:43.754 --> 00:32:44.215
sir.

00:32:44.216 --> 00:32:46.317
We've done around 2 crore 11 lakh rupees.

00:32:47.545 --> 00:32:48.766
Yesterday we finished our target.

00:32:48.767 --> 00:32:49.006
For November?

00:32:49.007 --> 00:32:49.247
Yes,

00:32:49.407 --> 00:32:51.168
we've achieved 100%

00:32:51.169 --> 00:32:51.268
sales.

00:32:51.269 --> 00:32:52.289
Now how are your fabric sales going?

00:32:52.329 --> 00:32:52.629
Amazingly well,

00:32:52.689 --> 00:32:55.991
we've had a growth of around 45%

00:32:55.992 --> 00:32:57.712
over the last year.

00:32:57.713 --> 00:32:58.493
And new shirtings,

00:32:58.494 --> 00:32:59.313
how are the new shirtings?

00:32:59.314 --> 00:33:01.395
They've done really good and it's sold out.

00:33:01.835 --> 00:33:02.936
two to three days.

00:33:02.937 --> 00:33:03.076
Really?

00:33:04.677 --> 00:33:05.058
The printed shirt,

00:33:05.059 --> 00:33:05.278
especially.

00:33:05.279 --> 00:33:06.499
That's very good.

00:33:06.500 --> 00:33:10.422
The Raymond brand was launched by Gautama's family at the beginning of the

00:33:10.822 --> 00:33:11.403
20th century.

00:33:12.043 --> 00:33:17.347
It was losing momentum when he took his father's place in the CEO's chair in 2000.

00:33:18.008 --> 00:33:20.790
The acclaimed company was in need for a dusting off,

00:33:21.030 --> 00:33:22.251
a diversification.

00:33:22.772 --> 00:33:23.652
Thanks to Gautama,

00:33:23.993 --> 00:33:24.413
today,

00:33:24.793 --> 00:33:27.455
Raymond is high-end and has increased in value.

00:33:30.517 --> 00:33:31.758
So this would be about

00:33:32.378 --> 00:33:33.679
3 lakh rupees a meter.

00:33:34.839 --> 00:33:37.120
So a suit length would be about

00:33:38.141 --> 00:33:41.222
14,000 euros for just the fabric for a suit.

00:33:41.842 --> 00:33:42.903
And then the stitching,

00:33:42.963 --> 00:33:43.143
etc.

00:33:44.144 --> 00:33:45.124
Raymond is a brand,

00:33:45.324 --> 00:33:45.544
you know,

00:33:45.545 --> 00:33:47.125
it really sells from 250 euros.

00:33:47.125 --> 00:33:50.688
...to 300,000 rupees a metre across the range.

00:33:50.708 --> 00:33:51.068
And we say,

00:33:51.069 --> 00:33:51.288
you know,

00:33:51.328 --> 00:33:52.730
from the taxi driver to Mr Tata,

00:33:52.870 --> 00:33:53.650
everybody wears the

00:33:54.291 --> 00:33:54.891
Raymond brand.

00:33:56.413 --> 00:33:57.233
In his stores,

00:33:57.514 --> 00:33:59.976
the Indian textile boss wears a suit and tie.

00:34:00.236 --> 00:34:01.257
But outside work,

00:34:01.457 --> 00:34:02.758
he prefers sportswear.

00:34:03.278 --> 00:34:08.222
That's because a day in the life of Gautama Singhania is a sprint from start to finish.

00:34:13.882 --> 00:34:16.743
And to get around Bombay the quickest possible way,

00:34:17.023 --> 00:34:18.164
he takes his helicopter.

00:34:18.544 --> 00:34:20.165
The best way to avoid the traffic.

00:34:21.245 --> 00:34:22.326
In the north of the city,

00:34:22.586 --> 00:34:23.806
the company's headquarters.

00:34:24.206 --> 00:34:28.688
A true American-style campus for the 1500 employees who work there.

00:34:29.029 --> 00:34:32.170
Between royal palm trees and impeccable lawns.

00:34:40.062 --> 00:34:44.826
Good to see you,

00:34:44.827 --> 00:34:45.627
by the time you arrive.

00:34:45.628 --> 00:34:45.707
Here,

00:34:45.708 --> 00:34:49.570
the Singanias have reigned supreme since they bought the old wool factory in the

00:34:49.990 --> 00:34:50.551
20th century.

00:34:50.971 --> 00:34:53.473
So when the boss arrives to prepare a new collection,

00:34:53.813 --> 00:34:55.114
tension rises a notch.

00:34:58.757 --> 00:35:10.105
To give the presentation to our CMD is very difficult because he's the person who is always looking for new developments and he has got the brilliant taste of the fabric.

00:35:10.665 --> 00:35:11.586
Looking at the fabrics,

00:35:11.587 --> 00:35:14.027
he will be able to tell you whether the fabric is from the 180s or

00:35:14.548 --> 00:35:17.430
200s, or it's from Baikonur or the Pashmina or the Kashmir.

00:35:17.450 --> 00:35:19.871
The boss arrives.

00:35:20.172 --> 00:35:23.294
His team has 30 minutes to convince and surprise him.

00:35:31.769 --> 00:35:34.071
We are also not looking for only one category.

00:35:34.552 --> 00:35:38.777
TechnoSmart can be one feature and we can develop many product categories under this.

00:35:39.338 --> 00:35:41.661
Our best development in TechnoSmart.

00:35:42.041 --> 00:35:43.203
TechnoSmart Next

00:35:49.663 --> 00:35:52.185
I have synthetic dyes.

00:35:52.225 --> 00:35:52.925
It's not wool,

00:35:52.945 --> 00:35:53.506
it's a little bit.

00:35:53.566 --> 00:35:53.966
Absolutely,

00:35:53.986 --> 00:35:54.106
sir.

00:35:54.166 --> 00:35:56.507
25-30%.

00:35:56.508 --> 00:36:00.069
The Indian textile prince is now at the heart of the family business.

00:36:00.470 --> 00:36:05.993
It is these woolen fibres that his family has worked on for a century that made him king.

00:36:06.357 --> 00:36:07.538
Like any good sovereign,

00:36:07.918 --> 00:36:10.920
Gautama Singhania has his court and his protocol.

00:36:11.541 --> 00:36:13.502
This is the antechamber of power.

00:36:13.742 --> 00:36:14.683
Behind this door,

00:36:15.083 --> 00:36:15.843
the throne room,

00:36:16.164 --> 00:36:19.186
has all the glory of this billionaire and his family.

00:36:19.326 --> 00:36:21.147
I'd rather put up memories of...

00:36:21.287 --> 00:36:23.148
pictures on my walls than put up,

00:36:24.048 --> 00:36:24.329
you know,

00:36:25.069 --> 00:36:25.509
paintings,

00:36:26.209 --> 00:36:27.070
which have no meaning to me.

00:36:28.290 --> 00:36:31.852
The Singhanias are an old family from the Rajasthan province.

00:36:32.172 --> 00:36:34.193
They are part of the Mawari community,

00:36:34.614 --> 00:36:36.594
merchants among the richest in the country.

00:36:37.035 --> 00:36:37.835
When you were growing up,

00:36:37.915 --> 00:36:41.517
did you always have this image in your head that you were one day going to be taking over this company?

00:36:41.557 --> 00:36:42.677
Were you groomed for this role?

00:36:43.178 --> 00:36:43.298
Yeah,

00:36:43.318 --> 00:36:45.579
I think from childhood you've been trained for this,

00:36:45.659 --> 00:36:45.959
that,

00:36:46.519 --> 00:36:46.759
you know,

00:36:46.760 --> 00:36:48.140
in our Mawari system,

00:36:48.900 --> 00:36:49.761
you are trained to...

00:36:49.941 --> 00:36:52.502
to get into the family business and you expected to do that.

00:36:52.542 --> 00:36:56.503
So whether it was dinner conversations or weekend conversations,

00:36:57.323 --> 00:36:59.344
a lot of conversations revolved around business,

00:36:59.384 --> 00:37:01.885
so you sort of learnt that way.

00:37:02.185 --> 00:37:03.905
Our Marwadi family all come from Rajasthan,

00:37:03.965 --> 00:37:05.546
from a small part called Sheikh Hawat,

00:37:05.686 --> 00:37:07.947
and therefore we're called Sheikh Hawati Marwadis.

00:37:09.047 --> 00:37:10.087
And for some strange reason,

00:37:10.107 --> 00:37:13.428
the Sheikh Hawati Marwadis have all gone out and become big businessmen.

00:37:17.945 --> 00:37:21.168
A fair for business which seems alive in the Singhania family.

00:37:21.549 --> 00:37:22.710
My elder daughter is very,

00:37:22.770 --> 00:37:24.091
very keen on running the business.

00:37:24.171 --> 00:37:27.314
She's been coming here since the age of five,

00:37:27.655 --> 00:37:28.716
trying to attend meetings.

00:37:28.736 --> 00:37:33.481
She walks around the office and asks around and is very inquisitive.

00:37:34.081 --> 00:37:34.422
It's good,

00:37:34.482 --> 00:37:35.643
but let's see.

00:37:36.043 --> 00:37:36.564
She's very young.

00:37:37.805 --> 00:37:43.790
A woman at the head of the group would be an earthquake in this world of men attached to their history and their traditions.

00:37:44.150 --> 00:37:45.051
For the Mawaris,

00:37:45.431 --> 00:37:48.354
it is family and community that take precedence.

00:37:50.635 --> 00:37:52.297
At the end of the CEO's day,

00:37:52.737 --> 00:37:54.879
Gautama Singhania likes to relax,

00:37:55.740 --> 00:37:57.121
without slowing down the pace.

00:38:03.501 --> 00:38:06.883
He built his own race circuit on his company's campus.

00:38:07.223 --> 00:38:09.064
Total cost of the cars and the track,

00:38:09.464 --> 00:38:11.565
nearly 250,000 euros.

00:38:12.106 --> 00:38:16.208
This discipline that he wants to launch in India is called the drift.

00:38:16.828 --> 00:38:20.410
It is the art of controlled skidding and engines that roar.

00:38:29.317 --> 00:38:46.505
We want to promote the sport so we just do this maybe two or three times a year where we tell people come and drift you know it's not a category wise or anything of that sort it's just you know bring whatever you got and people have this enthusiasm to take out some adrenaline

00:38:46.525 --> 00:38:47.105
and so they

00:38:47.165 --> 00:38:48.005
Come and do it on the track.

00:38:48.105 --> 00:38:50.746
Are you the godfather of drift in India?

00:38:50.747 --> 00:38:51.586
I don't say godfather,

00:38:51.587 --> 00:38:54.987
but I'm probably the only drifter from India.

00:38:55.267 --> 00:38:57.988
Far from high-end textiles and suit jackets,

00:38:58.248 --> 00:39:01.749
it is here that this speed demon gets his adrenaline rush.

00:39:02.449 --> 00:39:05.590
This taste for danger fascinates the Indian media,

00:39:05.890 --> 00:39:08.370
who are accustomed to the billionaire's escapades.

00:39:10.131 --> 00:39:16.158
India who has passion for speed and who can afford this passion and he has four drifting cars and then Ferraris,

00:39:16.218 --> 00:39:16.799
Lamborghinis,

00:39:16.800 --> 00:39:17.580
the best of the cars.

00:39:19.042 --> 00:39:19.623
Two years ago,

00:39:19.983 --> 00:39:25.029
Gautama Singhania decided to treat himself to the thrill of a true automobile competition.

00:39:40.341 --> 00:39:40.782
Despite

00:39:40.802 --> 00:39:41.943
his responsibilities,

00:39:42.143 --> 00:39:46.706
he has taken the time to travel the world to live out his dream and fly the colours of the Indian flag.

00:39:48.388 --> 00:39:54.453
The entrance to the

00:39:54.893 --> 00:39:58.336
ticket to this Sunday's sport event costs a million euros.

00:39:58.636 --> 00:39:59.417
At that price,

00:39:59.437 --> 00:40:02.720
the souvenir video looks like the trailer for an action film.

00:40:03.240 --> 00:40:04.061
For his first year,

00:40:04.341 --> 00:40:06.664
the novice finished fourth worldwide.

00:40:11.888 --> 00:40:12.489
This evening,

00:40:12.689 --> 00:40:16.712
he celebrates his season at this chic club in the center of Bombay,

00:40:17.013 --> 00:40:20.035
where the owner himself remembers the scale of his exploits.

00:40:24.747 --> 00:40:25.167
Having said that,

00:40:25.168 --> 00:40:29.891
I have to tell you it's probably one of the most competitive forms of motorsport I have ever seen.

00:40:30.471 --> 00:40:34.535
It's infinitely more competitive than Formula 1.

00:40:34.536 --> 00:40:36.637
No more turnovers or associates.

00:40:36.857 --> 00:40:38.118
Gautama Singhania,

00:40:38.198 --> 00:40:38.778
the racer,

00:40:39.099 --> 00:40:42.161
celebrates in style with a crown of admirers.

00:40:42.842 --> 00:40:44.823
Ultra-ambitious megalomaniacs,

00:40:45.044 --> 00:40:46.525
the Maharajas of today,

00:40:46.865 --> 00:40:49.507
see themselves as the heroes of modern India.

00:40:51.449 --> 00:40:52.750
But in the country of Gandhi,

00:40:52.890 --> 00:40:55.971
where 40 million children still suffer from malnutrition,

00:40:56.431 --> 00:40:59.893
some of these new Maharajas manage to avoid paying taxes.

00:41:00.533 --> 00:41:03.154
India ranks number one in the world for tax evasion.

00:41:03.674 --> 00:41:07.636
More than 500 billion euros are allegedly hidden abroad.

00:41:11.381 --> 00:41:12.862
India's most flamboyant,

00:41:12.962 --> 00:41:14.323
a willful defaulter.

00:41:14.523 --> 00:41:19.827
How does a business baron who owes banks thousands of crores of rupees get to leave the country?

00:41:20.047 --> 00:41:22.328
Now his passport has been revoked by the government.

00:41:23.649 --> 00:41:26.211
The icon of these tax evaders is V.

00:41:26.251 --> 00:41:26.892
Vijay Mallya,

00:41:27.192 --> 00:41:28.974
the boss of Kingfisher Beverages,

00:41:29.335 --> 00:41:31.377
nicknamed the Indian Richard Branson.

00:41:31.878 --> 00:41:34.221
He is a fan of luxury and beautiful women,

00:41:34.681 --> 00:41:36.003
and now he's on the run.

00:41:36.644 --> 00:41:39.587
After having made his fortune in the alcohol business,

00:41:39.887 --> 00:41:41.189
the party king wanted him to be

00:41:41.189 --> 00:41:42.170
his own planes.

00:41:42.490 --> 00:41:47.234
He launched an upscale airline as the Indian skies were already overloaded.

00:41:47.654 --> 00:41:51.978
The rise in oil prices ended up sinking his dream and deepening his debt.

00:41:52.618 --> 00:41:57.722
All of Vijay Mallya's Indian property was supposed to be put up for auction to pay his creditors.

00:41:58.243 --> 00:41:58.603
Villas,

00:41:58.703 --> 00:41:59.143
planes,

00:41:59.224 --> 00:41:59.704
cars.

00:42:00.064 --> 00:42:02.266
But several months after the billionaire's flight,

00:42:02.546 --> 00:42:07.050
his collectible car still shined behind the windows of this building in New Delhi,

00:42:07.430 --> 00:42:09.172
like a mockery to the tax office.

00:42:09.712 --> 00:42:10.753
Using hidden cameras,

00:42:11.033 --> 00:42:14.315
we discover dr malia's secret garage nice to meet you pleasure

00:42:16.957 --> 00:42:33.867
40 gleaming luxury cars make up this great collectors a small museum you wouldn't drive those cars dr maria no no you would have what a driver and uh

00:42:40.258 --> 00:42:44.721
How much do you think would this whole cost?

00:42:44.722 --> 00:42:45.942
A year itself would be about

00:42:46.402 --> 00:42:47.003
50 crores.

00:42:47.383 --> 00:42:48.083
50 crores.

00:42:48.464 --> 00:42:48.684
Right.

00:42:49.404 --> 00:42:53.367
The mechanic tells us that there is another bigger warehouse in the south of the city.

00:42:53.367 --> 00:43:04.300
city and no hint of a seizure to pay back his debts.

00:43:09.846 --> 00:43:11.126
The company belongs to Dr.

00:43:11.146 --> 00:43:11.346
Maria.

00:43:12.347 --> 00:43:12.467
Yeah.

00:43:12.468 --> 00:43:13.147
At the end of the day,

00:43:13.148 --> 00:43:13.708
it is...

00:43:14.128 --> 00:43:14.268
Yeah,

00:43:14.288 --> 00:43:15.188
that's his...

00:43:15.189 --> 00:43:16.089
That's still his toys.

00:43:18.450 --> 00:43:21.571
He left these jewels behind when he took the road to exile,

00:43:21.812 --> 00:43:22.272
or rather,

00:43:22.512 --> 00:43:23.973
to his golden retirement.

00:43:24.813 --> 00:43:46.305
we went to find him we traced him back to france to the cote d'azur just off cannes he's the owner of one of the most beautiful residences in the region on il saint marguerite also one of the most expensive his villa and its huge garden is estimated between 30 and 40 million euros for

00:43:46.325 --> 00:43:47.045
the islands in

00:43:47.125 --> 00:43:47.585
For the inhabitants,

00:43:47.906 --> 00:43:50.728
the extravagant high roller is a normal resident,

00:43:51.248 --> 00:43:52.730
but not an ordinary one.

00:43:53.090 --> 00:43:55.872
He has managed to get himself a few privileges.

00:44:12.305 --> 00:44:15.126
We know he has two big boats in the area.

00:44:15.127 --> 00:44:17.347
He would have a nice apartment in Monaco.

00:44:19.829 --> 00:44:21.209
I think he's fine on this side.

00:44:22.290 --> 00:44:24.851
While this huge garden is his haven of peace,

00:44:25.171 --> 00:44:27.172
Monaco is his stomping ground.

00:44:29.581 --> 00:44:35.187
Parties that he organizes during the Formula One Grand Prix have remained in everyone's memories,

00:44:35.507 --> 00:44:37.029
like this one three years ago,

00:44:37.629 --> 00:44:41.253
because VJ Malja loves a party in all its excess.

00:44:42.094 --> 00:44:45.437
Clément de Souza was his private DJ for 20 years.

